WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.614
Emmy wore a uniform, a hat, and running shoes.

2
00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:13.901
Today was her big track meet.

3
00:00:13.902 --> 00:00:19.332
"It's so windy," Harry said.

4
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:22.863
"You're lucky," Emmy said.

5
00:00:22.864 --> 00:00:30.093
"You don't have to compete in this wind!"

6
00:00:30.094 --> 00:00:33.980
"What events are you doing?" Mom asked.

7
00:00:33.981 --> 00:00:38.390
"Two races and the high jump," Emmy said.

8
00:00:38.391 --> 00:00:41.967
The family drove to the meet.

9
00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:44.993
Emmy found her teammates.

10
00:00:44.994 --> 00:00:50.227
Mom, Dad, Harry, and Oliver sat in the stands.

11
00:00:50.228 --> 00:00:53.226
Suddenly Emmy ran over.

12
00:00:53.227 --> 00:00:57.182
"I left my water bottle in the car!"

13
00:00:57.183 --> 00:01:01.171
"I'll get it," Harry said.

14
00:01:01.172 --> 00:01:05.748
Harry ran as fast as he could.

15
00:01:05.749 --> 00:01:09.187
When he got back, he was out of breath.

16
00:01:09.188 --> 00:01:12.574
He gave Emmy her water bottle.

17
00:01:12.575 --> 00:01:17.081
It was almost time for Emmy's first race.

18
00:01:17.082 --> 00:01:20.577
The wind blew.

19
00:01:20.578 --> 00:01:24.208
Emmy's jacket flew over the fence.

20
00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:29.371
"My jacket!" Emmy cried.

21
00:01:29.372 --> 00:01:32.450
"I'll get it!" Harry said.

22
00:01:32.451 --> 00:01:35.117
Harry ran fast.

23
00:01:35.118 --> 00:01:38.106
He jumped over the fence!

24
00:01:38.107 --> 00:01:46.547
He gave Emmy her jacket.

25
00:01:46.548 --> 00:01:50.719
Another wind blew.

26
00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:54.981
Emmy's hat tumbled across the track.

27
00:01:54.982 --> 00:01:59.971
Harry ran and grabbed it.

28
00:01:59.972 --> 00:02:02.028
"Emmy, catch!"

29
00:02:02.029 --> 00:02:05.540
Harry threw the hat like a discus.

30
00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:09.126
Emmy caught it.

31
00:02:09.127 --> 00:02:12.997
Finally Emmy's track meet was over.

32
00:02:12.998 --> 00:02:17.089
"I'm so tired!" Emmy said.

33
00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:27.160
Harry moaned. "So am I!"

